Nous built-in guard dataset (nous-builtin-guard 2026.11.0)

The cases in this directory are in the nous.guard_case/1 schema. Every case
records its source, licence, upstream revision and row in its "provenance".
Third-party material was sampled and reformatted (modified) into that schema;
labels were mapped from the upstream labels (deepset 1/0 and jackhhao
jailbreak/benign -> block/allow; Gandalf rows are all prompt injections;
XSTest "safe" prompts are allow-labelled hard negatives; InjecAgent tool
responses carrying an attacker instruction are block-labelled).

